【来源1】{"claim": "Jolene took a photo on vacation last summer in Bogota of a person walking on the beach with a surfboard, and found watching the sunset over the water beautiful and calming.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Jolene", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-02-04T09:48:00+00:00", "text": "Jolene: [Image: a photo of a person walking on the beach with a surfboard] Here's a picture I took on vacation last summer in Bogota. It was so beautiful and calming watching the sunset over the water. It definitely made me appreciate nature's calming power.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
