【来源9】{"claim": "Jolene is really into the book \"Sapiens\", which she describes as a fascinating look at human history and how technology has affected us.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Jolene", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-02-04T09:48:00+00:00", "text": "Jolene: Thanks Deborah! I'm really into this book called \"Sapiens\" - it's a fascinating look at human history and how technology has affected us. It's giving me a lot to think about!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
