【来源11】{"claim": "Jolene did a mini retreat on the Wednesday before 2023-02-09 to assess where she is at in life, and it gave her a new outlook.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Jolene", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-02-09T21:03:00+00:00", "text": "Jolene: Hey Deborah! Been a few days since we last talked so I wanted to fill you in on something cool. Last Wednesday I did a mini retreat to assess where I'm at in life. It was a dope experience that totally gave me a new outlook.", "context_only": false, "time_derivations": [{"expression": "Last Wednesday", "start": "2023-02-08", "end_exclusive": "2023-02-09", "precision": "day", "rule": "strict_previous_or_next_weekday"}]}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源12】{"claim": "Jolene wants to keep working in engineering and continue making a positive impact on communities in need by creating sustainable solutions.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Jolene", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-02-04T09:48:00+00:00", "text": "Jolene: I want to keep working in engineering and continue to make a positive impact on communities in need by creating sustainable solutions. My goal is to contribute towards making the world a better place with my work.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源13】{"claim": "Jolene is planning the volunteer STEM program by teaming up with local schools/centers to do workshops and inviting engineers as guest speakers.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Jolene", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-02-09T21:03:00+00:00", "text": "Jolene: Haven't finished planning yet but I'm thinking of teaming up with local schools/centers to do workshops. We could even invite engineers as guest speakers to show kids their career options.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源14】{"claim": "Jolene is currently really enjoying working on the robotics project, comparing it to solving a puzzle and finding seeing the robot come together awesome.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Jolene", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-02-01T19:03:00+00:00", "text": "Jolene: When I got it, I felt a mix of emotions - excited and nervous. But now, I'm really enjoying it! It's like trying to solve a puzzle, figuring out the best design and programming. Seeing the robot come together is awesome too!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源15】{"claim": "Jolene is determined to keep going and make a difference, and Deborah's encouragement motivates her to pursue her passions.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Jolene", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-02-04T09:48:00+00:00", "text": "Jolene: Your support means a lot. I'm determined to keep going and make a difference. Your encouragement really motivates me to pursue my passions.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源16】{"claim": "Jolene has been on an emotional rollercoaster lately but is coping.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Jolene", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-02-04T09:48:00+00:00", "text": "Jolene: Hey Deborah! Good to hear from you. How've you been? I've been on an emotional rollercoaster lately, but I'm coping.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源17】{"claim": "Jolene felt it was a surreal moment when she saw the water purifier working and providing clean water to the community, which was incredibly satisfying.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Jolene", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-02-04T09:48:00+00:00", "text": "Jolene: It was such a surreal moment. Seeing it working and providing clean water to the community was incredibly satisfying. It reminded me of how engineering can make a difference in people's lives. It made me feel like I had a purpose and had done something good.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
